    {
      "id": "sketch-heavy",
      "name": "Sketch-heavy",
      "description": "Workloads where a sketch family is the cheapest plan that meets the accuracy target, with controls next to them. heavy-hitters: topk(10, sum by (url) (rate(http_requests_total[W]))) over 100 to 10,000 URLs at L1- or L2-normalized targets (Count-Min or Count Sketch with a heap). frequency-moments: l2_over_time over 1 to 16 value streams (UnivMon). distinct: SQL COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) at 100,000 or 2,000,000 rows/s and PromQL distinct_over_time (KMV). mixed: several queries that could share one sketch. blocked: SQL top-k, L2, entropy, point counts and HLL-shaped distinct counts, which no sketch serves yet.",
